@startuml
title Sprint-4 Unified UML (UC-016, UC-018, UC-019)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class SecurityAnalyst <<actor>>
class SIEMDetectionEngine <<actor>>

class Sprint4AutomationEngine {
  -evidence_file: Path
  -revoked_api_keys: set<(str,str)>
  -blocked_admin_users: set<str>
  -tickets: list<dict>
  -_append_evidence(uc_id, event, action, status, details): void
  +uc_016_revoke_api_key(user_id, api_key_id, compromised): MitigationResult
  +uc_018_block_admin_login(username, is_admin_console, risk_score, threshold=0.85): MitigationResult
  +uc_019_create_containment_ticket(entity, severity, context): MitigationResult
  +run_uc_action(uc_id, payload): MitigationResult
}

class MitigationResult {
  +uc_id: str
  +action: str
  +status: str
  +reason: str
  +timestamp: str
}

class UC016_AutoRevokeApiKey <<usecase>>
class UC018_AutoBlockAdminLogin <<usecase>>
class UC019_CreateContainmentTicket <<usecase>>
class EvidenceJSONL <<artifact>>

SIEMDetectionEngine --> Sprint4AutomationEngine : triggers payload
SecurityAnalyst --> Sprint4AutomationEngine : runs/validates

Sprint4AutomationEngine --> UC016_AutoRevokeApiKey : dispatch UC-016
Sprint4AutomationEngine --> UC018_AutoBlockAdminLogin : dispatch UC-018
Sprint4AutomationEngine --> UC019_CreateContainmentTicket : dispatch UC-019

UC016_AutoRevokeApiKey --> MitigationResult : returns
UC018_AutoBlockAdminLogin --> MitigationResult : returns
UC019_CreateContainmentTicket --> MitigationResult : returns

Sprint4AutomationEngine --> EvidenceJSONL : append evidence

note right of Sprint4AutomationEngine
Dispatcher flow:
1) run_uc_action(uc_id, payload)
2) Route to UC-016 / UC-018 / UC-019
3) Produce MitigationResult
4) Append JSONL evidence
5) Return result to caller
end note
@enduml
